 equations of an ellipse centered at the point $(h,k)$ with a horizontal radius of length $a$ and a vertical radius of length $b$ are\n\n$$\nx=a\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta +h,\\,y=b\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta +k,\\,\\theta \\in [0,2\\pi ).\n$$\n\nUnder this parametrization, the ellipse is traversed once in the counterclockwise direction, starting from $(h+a,k).$\n\nIn our case, the ellipse is centered at the point $(-3,2),$ $a=7$ and $b=4.$ Therefore, the parametric equations of the ellipse are \n\n$$\nx=7\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta -3,\\,y=4\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta +2,\\,\\theta \\in [0,2\\pi ).\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-106399/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "6d82541c-40ca-5df9-aa17-c20b201fadd4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-106399"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-106403/selection/254f7dc7c93945f5d800c08002268b921573aada24b982a69940059f541d28cc" :answer/id #uuid "aab5ddc9-f49e-5fd0-b606-d11407d8acb4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\theta \\in [0,\\frac{\\pi }{2}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106403/selection/9fdffdcefa2669090517ba484e29f6ed00149d1445e92f5c983188190ce91794" :answer/id #uuid "2dc96b9a-8eeb-5310-9807-6ca8ce081d4c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\theta \\in [\\frac{\\pi }{2},2\\pi ]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106403/selection/bc3e76ff6c2251409d67bd4d44714df545c2e1406f35c243db21f791e2a3cb52" :answer/id #uuid "ff57b5dd-26fe-5987-869d-6c13123b95c8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\theta \\in [0,\\frac{3\\pi }{2}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106403/selection/869e92fa37d662618b5776b5688120805f6a4ef64944d68a09668a86e88acb88" :answer/id #uuid "058e4a15-e6e5-5a54-991a-9308912db547" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\theta \\in [\\pi ,\\frac{3\\pi }{2}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106403/selection/83d70e0048515696e5c